.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
.Dd October 13, 2026
.Dt DTFL-DIAG 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm dtfl-diag
.Nd inspect a timely or differential dataflow computation
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl i Ar iface
.Op Fl p Ar port
.Op Fl P Ar diff-port
.Op Fl s Ar peers
.Op Fl f Ar file ...
.Op Fl o Ar path
.Cm graph | profile | arrangements
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is the C port of the timely dataflow
.Xr tdiag 1
tool.
It reconstructs the operator graph, the timing profile and the
arrangement sizes of a running computation from its structured log
streams, or from a recorded stream read from a file.
.Pp
The source program ships its log streams to
.Nm
over TCP.
Add a few lines to the source program to connect its
.Dq timely
logger
.Pq and, for Cm arrangements , its Dq differential/arrange logger
to the address
.Nm
listens on, as
.Xr dtfl_config_from_env 3
installs from
.Ev TIMELY_WORKER_LOG_ADDR
and
.Ev DIFFERENTIAL_LOG_ADDR .
.Ss Options
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl i , Fl Fl interface Ar ip
Interface to listen on; defaults to 127.0.0.1.
.It Fl p , Fl Fl port Ar port
Timely log port; defaults to 51317.
.It Fl P , Fl Fl diff-port Ar port
Differential log port; defaults to 51318.
.It Fl s , Fl Fl source-peers Ar n
Number of workers in the source computation.
.It Fl f , Fl Fl file Ar file
Read a recorded log stream from
.Ar file
instead of listening.
Repeatable, one per source worker.
.It Fl Fl diff-file Ar file
A recorded differential stream file for
.Cm arrangements .
Repeatable.
.It Fl o , Fl Fl out Ar path
.Cm graph :
output HTML path; defaults to
.Pa dataflow-graph.html .
.It Fl Fl output-interval Ar ms
.Cm arrangements :
reporting cadence in milliseconds; defaults to 1000.
.El
.Ss Commands
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Cm graph
Reconstruct the dataflow graph from the Operates and Channels events
and write an HTML file that renders it.
Channels crossing a scope
boundary are re-wired as in the upstream graph command.
.It Cm profile
Pair Schedule Start and Stop events to accumulate the time spent in
each operator, and print the operators sorted by total time.
.It Cm arrangements
Track the logical size of each arrangement from the Batch, Merge and
Drop events, and print the current size per operator.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ev DTFL_DATA_DIR
Directory holding
.Pa dataflow-graph.html ,
the template the
.Cm graph
command embeds.
Defaults to the installed data directory.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr dtfl_config_from_env 3 ,
.Xr dtfl_diag_session_new 3 ,
.Xr dtfl 7
.Sh STANDARDS
Ported from the dataflow-diag
.Pa tdiag
crate at commit 0fa322c9.
It reads the current bincode log stream, not
the 0.11 abomonation stream
.Pq PLAN D9 .
